  "description": "<p><strong>Scenario:</strong> The character steels themself against poison, exhaustion-like hazards, or a blast of physical force, adding 1d4 to a failed Constitution save. It is only available for the character's own save against a hostile source.</p><p><strong>Setup:</strong> Drag this Active Effect onto the actor who should own the External Reaction option. All changes use Override mode. If an option has a count requirement, that resource is spent when the option is accepted, according to External Reaction's count handling.</p>",
